8. Simulation & Validation Metrics

Recommended evaluation metrics:

Navigation
   •   Drift: \|\hat{r}-r\| over mission segment
   •   Attitude error: \angle(q, q^\*)

Energy/Thermal
   •   Constraint violations count
   •   Mean power efficiency: delivered work per Joule
   •   Thermal margin: \min(T_{max}-T)

FDIR
   •   Detection delay
   •   False alarm rate
   •   Recovery success rate

Governance
   •   Unauthorized action rate (target 0)
   •   Audit completeness and replayability

